{
  "page": 2,
  "width": 594.0,
  "height": 774.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "bbox": [
        233.54879760742188,
        32.086029052734375,
        366.4486999511719,
        47.026031494140625
      ],
      "text": "WELCOME TO CALL OF CTHULHU"
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "bbox": [
        294.2185974121094,
        720.1002807617188,
        305.7825927734375,
        737.5302734375
      ],
      "text": "19"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        77.97799682617188,
        158.4808807373047,
        96.69999694824219
      ],
      "text": "Pushing The Roll?"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        92.98200225830078,
        290.26708984375,
        108.30000305175781
      ],
      "text": "If the players fail the roll, ask if they want to persist in their "
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        104.98200225830078,
        290.2581787109375,
        120.30000305175781
      ],
      "text": "efforts to gain access to the clippings files. If they choose "
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        116.98200225830078,
        290.24822998046875,
        132.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "to do so, they may attempt a Pushed roll by continuing to "
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        128.98199462890625,
        290.2850646972656,
        144.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "pressure Arty in some way (they may change their approach "
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        140.98199462890625,
        226.9502716064453,
        156.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "and use an alternate method at this point). "
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        152.98199462890625,
        290.3129577636719,
        168.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "Depending on their course of action you should decide on "
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        164.98199462890625,
        281.5172424316406,
        180.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "what will happen if they fail (a consequence); for example:"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "bbox": [
        76.0,
        188.98199462890625,
        290.24981689453125,
        204.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "•\t If the investigators are using Intimidate, the consequence "
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "bbox": [
        84.0,
        200.98199462890625,
        290.27911376953125,
        216.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "might be that Arty calls their bluff, leading to an exchange "
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "bbox": [
        84.0,
        212.98199462890625,
        115.77809143066406,
        228.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "of blows."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "bbox": [
        76.0,
        224.98199462890625,
        290.2501220703125,
        240.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "•\t If the investigators are using Charm or Persuade, the "
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "bbox": [
        84.0,
        236.98199462890625,
        290.3030090332031,
        252.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "consequence might be that Arty takes offence and screams "
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "bbox": [
        84.0,
        248.98199462890625,
        142.1669921875,
        264.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "at them to leave."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        272.98199462890625,
        290.3085632324219,
        288.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Whatever the consequence, ensure that it escalates beyond "
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        284.98199462890625,
        290.293212890625,
        300.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Arty just asking them to leave—for example, have Arty call "
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        296.98199462890625,
        262.6712951660156,
        312.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "on some strong-armed maintenance men for backup."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        317.9779968261719,
        164.92803955078125,
        336.70001220703125
      ],
      "text": "The Clippings Files"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        332.98199462890625,
        290.29412841796875,
        348.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "If the investigators gain access, describe the dusty shelves of "
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        344.98199462890625,
        167.04718017578125,
        360.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "the clippings files morgue."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        368.98199462890625,
        281.0854797363281,
        384.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "You are taken down some steps by Ruth Blake, the records "
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        380.98199462890625,
        281.0601501464844,
        396.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "keeper, into a dusty basement filled with filing cabinets and "
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        392.98199462890625,
        281.04937744140625,
        408.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "stacked high with old newspapers and other assorted junk. "
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        404.98199462890625,
        281.0772705078125,
        420.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "The whole room smells musty and the boiler system in the "
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        416.98199462890625,
        177.1272430419922,
        432.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "corner gives out a lot of heat."
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        440.98199462890625,
        290.27532958984375,
        456.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "The pertinent clippings are filed by street address. Since "
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        452.98199462890625,
        290.3031311035156,
        468.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "the players have already had to succeed in dice rolls to get "
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        464.98199462890625,
        290.31744384765625,
        480.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "in to the morgue it would be churlish stop them getting "
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        476.98199462890625,
        289.7991027832031,
        492.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "the one clue that is here, so it should be made obvious. Pass "
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        488.98199462890625,
        190.24949645996094,
        504.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "Handout 2 (page 30) to a player."
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        509.9779968261719,
        123.05098724365234,
        528.7000122070312
      ],
      "text": "Handout 2"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        524.9819946289062,
        290.28192138671875,
        540.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "Unpublished Story, Boston Globe 1918: A feature story, "
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        536.9819946289062,
        290.30303955078125,
        552.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "which was never published. It states that in 1880, a family "
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        548.9819946289062,
        290.2940979003906,
        564.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "of French immigrants moved into the house but fled after "
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        560.9819946289062,
        290.30853271484375,
        576.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "a series of violent accidents left the parents dead and three "
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        572.9819946289062,
        241.29623413085938,
        588.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "children crippled. The house long stood vacant."
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "bbox": [
        81.0,
        584.9819946289062,
        290.2841796875,
        600.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "In 1909, another family moved in and immediately fell "
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        596.9819946289062,
        290.2859191894531,
        612.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "prey to illnesses. In 1914, the oldest brother went mad and "
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        608.9819946289062,
        290.3120422363281,
        624.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "killed himself with a kitchen knife, and the heartbroken "
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        620.9819946289062,
        290.3066101074219,
        636.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "family moved out. In 1918, a third family, the Macarios, "
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        632.9819946289062,
        290.3030700683594,
        648.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "rented the house, but they left almost immediately under "
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        644.9819946289062,
        165.5811004638672,
        660.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "mysterious circumstances."
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "bbox": [
        320.9988098144531,
        80.98200225830078,
        530.2571411132812,
        96.30000305175781
      ],
      "text": "If an investigator flirts with or befriends Ruth Blake, the "
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        92.98200225830078,
        530.2579345703125,
        108.30000305175781
      ],
      "text": "record keeper in the clippings file (don’t bother with dice "
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        104.98200225830078,
        530.3101806640625,
        120.30000305175781
      ],
      "text": "here, the information isn’t crucial), she remarks that the "
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        116.98200225830078,
        530.2479858398438,
        132.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "Globe files go back no further than a fire in 1878. If the "
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        128.98199462890625,
        530.2832641601562,
        144.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "Corbitt House is mentioned earlier than that, there is no "
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        140.98199462890625,
        371.7760314941406,
        156.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "record of it here."
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        170.35000610351562,
        426.04248046875,
        201.47500610351562
      ],
      "text": "LOCATION 3: "
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        194.35000610351562,
        502.2488708496094,
        225.47500610351562
      ],
      "text": "THE CENTRAL LIBRARY"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        224.98199462890625,
        530.310302734375,
        240.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "This worthy institution has several interesting items tucked "
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        236.98199462890625,
        530.31005859375,
        252.3000030517578
      ],
      "text": "away. For each half-day spent in research at the library, ask "
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        248.98199462890625,
        530.2761840820312,
        264.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "each player to make a Library Use roll (rolling equal to or "
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        260.98199462890625,
        530.31201171875,
        276.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "less than their skill on 1D100). If failed, there is no need to "
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        272.98199462890625,
        530.3198852539062,
        288.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "push the roll; the players can simply keep trying again and "
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        284.98199462890625,
        530.3109130859375,
        300.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "again, but each roll means they have spent half a day more "
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        296.98199462890625,
        530.3111572265625,
        312.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "in research. If they spend more than a day researching, have "
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        308.98199462890625,
        530.266845703125,
        324.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "their employer, Mr. Knott, contact them to ask how things are "
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        320.98199462890625,
        530.26513671875,
        336.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "progressing, urging them to resolve their investigations—time "
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        332.98199462890625,
        374.4939270019531,
        348.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "is money after all."
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "bbox": [
        320.9988098144531,
        344.98199462890625,
        530.2836303710938,
        360.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "For each success, give out one of the following Handouts "
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        356.98199462890625,
        348.7548522949219,
        372.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "(in order)."
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        377.9779968261719,
        363.0498046875,
        396.70001220703125
      ],
      "text": "Handout 3"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        392.98199462890625,
        530.28564453125,
        408.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "In 1835, a prosperous merchant builds the house, but "
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        404.98199462890625,
        528.6599731445312,
        420.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "immediately falls ill and sells it to a Mr. Walter Corbitt, esquire."
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        425.9779968261719,
        363.0498046875,
        444.70001220703125
      ],
      "text": "Handout 4"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        440.98199462890625,
        530.308349609375,
        456.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "In 1852, Walter Corbitt is sued by neighbours, who petition "
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        452.98199462890625,
        530.0804443359375,
        468.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "to force him to leave the area “in consequence of his surious [sic] "
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        464.98199462890625,
        431.57098388671875,
        480.29998779296875
      ],
      "text": "habits and unauspicious demeanor.”"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        485.9779968261719,
        363.0498046875,
        504.70001220703125
      ],
      "text": "Handout 5"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        500.98199462890625,
        530.2660522460938,
        516.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "Evidently Corbitt wins the lawsuit. His obituary in 1866 "
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        512.9819946289062,
        530.3155517578125,
        528.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "states that he still lived in the same place. It also states that "
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        524.9819946289062,
        530.3103637695312,
        540.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "a second lawsuit was being waged to prevent Corbitt from "
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        536.9819946289062,
        502.1574401855469,
        552.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "being buried in his basement, as provided by his will."
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        557.97802734375,
        363.0498046875,
        576.7000122070312
      ],
      "text": "Handout 6"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "bbox": [
        311.9988098144531,
        572.9819946289062,
        478.667236328125,
        588.2999877929688
      ],
      "text": "No outcome to the second lawsuit is recorded."
    }
  ],
